ave given for giannis  tentacombo was how they proceeded in  these playoffs  they showed giannis on tv every night in  front of him in that second round  that they were a winning organization  they already had south beach they  already had pat riley and his  championship rings  but they showed giannis that they could  win with this group  they could win they could say imagine  what we can do if you join this team in  a year plus  when's the next season start  at this point i've long believed martin  luther king day was the earliest date  we might even see this bleed into  february  um you know in talking to a few  executives about this late last night  nobody really has any idea like they're  playing it week to week they know that  adam silver  wants to get fans back in the building  and if it means  pushing the season a little bit further  into the fall  uh or the winter rather they silver  might be willing to do that if it means  they can get  x number of games all in buildings all  with fans  i think that is the top priority right  now but i would not expect teams  to be back into training camp before  january and at this point it might be  early to mid february before we see an  nba season start  thanks for all your contributions this  year certainly from inside the bubble  and outside  and uh we'll talk to you soon thank you  chris  bye lakers fans

